        <p source="#source-11148-11180"><seg source="#source-11148-11180">一盞の濁酒ささげん。</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-11180-11206"><seg source="#source-11180-11206">秋の日の水晶薫り</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-11206-11241"><seg source="#source-11206-11241">餓ゑて知る道のとほきを</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-11241-11258"><seg source="#source-11241-11258">おん手の葦</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-11258-11297"><seg source="#source-11258-11297">おん足の泥まみれなる。</seg></p>
