        <p source="#source-11564-11605"><seg source="#source-11564-11582">ゆびさきの刺</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-11582-11600"><rb>疼</rb><rt>うづ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-11600-11605">き</seg></p>
        <p source="#source-11605-11613"><seg source="#source-11605-11613">眞實</seg></p>
