        <p source="#source-12419-12467"><seg source="#source-12419-12437">ひばりの巣を</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-12437-12455"><rb>發見</rb><rt>みつ</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-12455-12467">け。</seg></p>
